    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n113016" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χᾰλῑν-οω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bridle</i> or <i>bit</i> a horse, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				3.3.27
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>An.</u>
				3.4.35
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>HG</u>
				7.2.21
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				5.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				3.65.6
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			metaph., <i>curb, bridle, check,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν ναῦν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>VA</u>
					3.23
				</span></i>
			; [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φόβον, ἐπιθυμίαν</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Epicur.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				485
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν ὀργήν, τὸν θυμόν,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ps.-Phoc.
				57
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Them.
				<u>Or.</u>
				34p.454Dind.
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ φιλόφωνον καὶ λάλον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.967b
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν ἀλογίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
